## Benchmark Data License

The Vi-ViDoRe benchmark data (queries, qrels, document metadata) is subject to the licenses of the source documents as recorded in `data/governance/document_registry.csv`. 

**Important**: The benchmark includes documents under various licenses (CC BY 3.0 IGO, institutional licenses, etc.). Users must verify and comply with individual document licenses before redistribution. See `data/governance/document_registry.csv` for per-document license information.

The benchmark annotations (human relevance judgments) are released under CC BY 4.0.